OL,3,GNEWSASkeleton finds add #1.6m to cost
OL,4,Aof city's walkway
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterborough City Council's cabinet
OL,7,Fwill be asked to approve an additional
OL,8,F#1.6m for the city's Station Quarter
OL,9,Fregeneration project.
OL,11,FWork on the first phase of the #65m
OL,12,Fscheme is already under way, including
OL,13,Fthe construction of a walkway over
OL,14,FQueensgate roundabout, which will
OL,15,Fconnect Peterborough railway station
OL,16,Fwith Cowgate.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
