OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASkeleton finds add #1.6m to cost
OL,4,Aof city's walkway
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said "good progress" was
OL,7,Fbeing made on the City Link, but said a
OL,8,Fcombination of international events and
OL,9,Fdiscovery of more than 60 skeletons
OL,10,Fbeneath the roundabout has delayed
OL,11,Fcompletion by 11 weeks and increased
OL,12,Fcosts.
OL,14,FTo cover the expense, the cabinet will
OL,15,Fbe asked at a meeting on 1 October to
OL,16,Fapprove reallocation of a portion of
OL,17,Fits #5m Towns Fund for the project.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
